tools/generate_saturation_icons.py extracts the first four 9x9 yellow outlines
into src/saturation_icons.rs without changing their opaque pixels or colors.
The hunger-gain selection and saturation thresholds follow the original
java/squeek/appleskin/client/HUDOverlayHandler.java at that revision.

